        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml TrackWIL_Architecture\ntitle TrackWIL - Logical architecture (MVP)\n\nskinparam componentStyle rectangle\nskinparam shadowing false\n\nactor \&quot;Student\&quot; as student\nactor \&quot;Coordinator\&quot; as coord\nactor \&quot;Host employer\\n(no account)\&quot; as mentor\n\nnode \&quot;Web browser\&quot; as browserStudent\nnode \&quot;Web browser\&quot; as browserCoord\nnode \&quot;Web browser\&quot; as browserMentor\n\ncloud \&quot;HTTPS\&quot; as https\n\npackage \&quot;Next.js application (Node.js)\&quot; {\n  [Presentation layer\\nReact pages &amp; components] as ui\n  [Application layer\\nServer Actions\\nauth | logbook | verify] as actions\n  [Access control\\nproxy + session cookie] as session\n  [Data access\\nrepository] as repo\n}\n\nfolder \&quot;Persistence (MVP)\&quot; {\n  database \&quot;users.json\&quot; as users\n  database \&quot;logbook_entries.json\&quot; as entries\n  database \&quot;verification_tokens.json\&quot; as tokens\n  folder \&quot;uploads/\&quot; as uploads\n}\n\ndatabase \&quot;Relational DB\\n(target deployment)\\nsee trackwil_database_schema.sql\&quot; as sql #line.dashed\n\nstudent --&gt; browserStudent\ncoord --&gt; browserCoord\nmentor --&gt; browserMentor\n\nbrowserStudent --&gt; https\nbrowserCoord --&gt; https\nbrowserMentor --&gt; https\n\nhttps --&gt; ui\nui --&gt; actions\nactions --&gt; session\nactions --&gt; repo\nrepo --&gt; users\nrepo --&gt; entries\nrepo --&gt; tokens\nactions --&gt; uploads\n\nrepo ..&gt; sql : migrate later\\n(same logical model)\n\nnote right of mentor\n  Mentor uses only\n  /verify/{token}\n  no login\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="yhJiXOkAPhCt-YcSxwky-1">
